From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:27:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(llama-cpp): carry upstream's SYCL dmmv cleanup
 (ggml-org/llama.cpp#31325)

Carried as a llama.cpp patch beside the others
(patches/0009-sycl-dmmv-cleanup.patch): upstream commit 5e18eb02 (merged
2026-11-02, after our pin ddf48f8), ggml/src/ggml-sycl/dmmv.cpp only, +41/-411,
"a no-op for performance": the q8_0 reorder dmmv folded into the generic
template and the non-K launchers templated. Taken ahead of LocalAI's pin on
the operator's word (2026-11-07: "Add the patch 1 as well"), into the same
engine as the B70 AOT build and the pinned Intel stack, so every space is
gated once. It applies on ddf48f8 unchanged and touches nothing P5 does.

Assisted-by: Claude Code
